Multi_RATs_Adding_too_many_cells
    [Documentation]
    ...   Based on QC test case:
    ...   47_CB005973_D_[OBSAI]_Muliti_RATs_Adding_too_many_cells_[Robustness]
    ...   Test verifies BTS behavior after adding new cell that exceedes HW capacity of existing configuration.
    ...   In this scenario BTS should properly return fault 1868, BTS configuration error (not enough HW for LCR).
    ...   Test is performed in two ways:
    ...       1. Adding new cells via delta files. (this option is deprecated and will be removed in the future)
    ...       2. Adding new cells via scf files.
    ...   Please make sure that delta and scf files are up to date and contain proper configuration to avoid any issues.
    ...   Best to prepare these files on the same SW version.
    ...   Args:
    ...              - path_to_scf - Path to base scf file.
    ...              - deltas - List of full paths to json delta files that added new cells to existing configuration
    ...                         (please refer to generate_json_delta method in JsonDeltaCommissioning.py).
    ...                         Separate delta should be generated for each SW stream with objects under "added" key.
    ...              - modified_scf_list - List of full paths to scf files that adds new cells to existing configuration.

    [Arguments]                             ${path_to_scf}
    ...                                     ${deltas}=${None}
    ...                                     ${modified_scf_list}=${None}
    [Timeout]                               120min

    Create admin session with default alias
    ${bts_type}=                            hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${cells_per_rat}=                       admin_info_model.get_cell_ids_from_configured_rats
    ...                                     connection=${connection}

    Run Keyword If                          bool(${deltas} and ${modified_scf_list})
        ...                                 Fail  Both `deltas` and `modified_scf_list` args are provided. Please provide only one of them.
        ...                                 ELSE IF  not bool(${deltas} or ${modified_scf_list})
        ...                                 Fail  No `deltas` or `modified_scf_list` args provided. Please provide one of them.

    Run Keyword If                          bool(${deltas})
        ...                                 Add Too Many Cells Via Delta
        ...                                 path_to_scf=${path_to_scf}
        ...                                 deltas=${deltas}
        ...                                 cells_per_rat=${cells_per_rat}
        ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
        ...                                 connection=${connection}

    Run Keyword If                          bool(${modified_scf_list})
        ...                                 Add Too Many Cells Via SCF
        ...                                 path_to_scf=${path_to_scf}
        ...                                 modified_scf_list=${modified_scf_list}
        ...                                 cells_per_rat=${cells_per_rat}
        ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
        ...                                 connection=${connection}

    [Teardown]                              Run Keyword if  """${KEYWORD_STATUS}""" == "FAIL"
    ...                                     Run Keywords
    ...                                     Allow DSS alarms
    ...                                     AND
    ...                                     Robot log operation    Returning to base configuration
    ...                                     AND
    ...                                     Perform Commissioning And Wait For OnAir  scf_path=${path_to_scf}
    ...                                     AND
    ...                                     Disallow Fault 1868
    ...                                     AND
    ...                                     Disallow DSS alarms

Add Too Many Cells Via SCF
    [Arguments]                             ${path_to_scf}
    ...                                     ${modified_scf_list}
    ...                                     ${cells_per_rat}
    ...                                     ${bts_type}
    ...                                     ${connection}

    ${path_to_base_migrated_scf}  ${migrated_scf_list}=  Migrate SCF Files To New Version
    ...                                                  path_to_scf=${path_to_scf}
    ...                                                  modified_scf_list=${modified_scf_list}
    ...                                                  connection=${connection}

    FOR  ${path_to_modified_scf}  IN  @{migrated_scf_list}
        ${path_to_delta}                    Add Cells Via SCF
        ...                                 path_to_base_scf=${path_to_base_migrated_scf}
        ...                                 path_to_modified_scf=${path_to_modified_scf}
        ...                                 cells_per_rat=${cells_per_rat}
        Check If Added Cells Are Present
        ...                                 base_cells_config=${cells_per_rat}
        ...                                 path_to_delta=${path_to_delta}
        Wait For Expected Fault 1868
        Delete Cells Via SCF                path_to_base_scf=${path_to_base_migrated_scf}
        ...                                 path_to_modified_scf=${path_to_modified_scf}
        ...                                 cells_per_rat=${cells_per_rat}
        Check If Deleted Cells Are No Longer Present
        ...                                 base_cells_config=${cells_per_rat}
    END

Add Cells Via SCF
    [Arguments]                             ${path_to_base_scf}
    ...                                     ${path_to_modified_scf}
    ...                                     ${cells_per_rat}
    ...                                     ${timeout}=120

    Allow Fault 1868
    Allow DSS alarms
    Allow X2 Link Alarms

    ${path_to_delta}=                       delta_commissioning.generate_json_delta
    ...                                     base_scf=${path_to_base_scf}
    ...                                     custom_scf=${path_to_modified_scf}
    ...                                     delta_file=commissioning_delta

    Robot Log Operation                     Adding cells...
    delta.perform_online_delta_commissioning
    ...                                     path_to_delta=${path_to_delta}
    ...                                     timeout=${timeout}

    Robot Log Operation                     Checking if there's no BTS site reset after adding cells to configuration...
    Check If BTS Reset Was Not Performed
    Robot Log Result                        Cells added successfully

    [Return]                                ${path_to_delta}

    [Teardown]                              Wait Until Keyword Succeeds             15min  5sec
    ...                                     Check All Devices And Cells States For All RATs With Added Cells
    ...                                     cells_per_rat=${cells_per_rat}

Delete Cells Via SCF
    [Arguments]                             ${path_to_base_scf}
    ...                                     ${path_to_modified_scf}
