    Robot log result                        Cells removed successfully

    [Teardown]                              Wait Until Keyword Succeeds             15min  5sec
    ...                                     Check All Devices And Cells States For All RATs With Added Cells
    ...                                     cells_per_rat=${cells_per_rat}

Add Too Many Cells Via Delta
    [Arguments]                             ${path_to_scf}
    ...                                     ${deltas}
    ...                                     ${cells_per_rat}
    ...                                     ${bts_type}
    ...                                     ${connection}
    Robot Log Deprecation                   Adding too many cells using `deltas` arg is deprecated and will be removed in the future. Use `modified_scf_list` arg instead.

    Create Selenium Session                 admin_connection=${connection}
    ${sw_stream}=                           sw_stream.get_sw_stream
    ...                                     device=${bts_type}

    ${config_index}                         Set Variable  ${1}
    FOR  ${delta}  IN  @{deltas}
        ${plan_name}=                       Set Variable If  """${sw_stream}""">="""SBTS25R2"""
        ...                                 CONF-${config_index}_${delta.split("/")[-1].split(".")[0]}
        ...                                 CONF-${config_index}
        Add Cells Via Delta
        ...                                 path_to_delta=${delta}
        ...                                 path_to_scf=${path_to_scf}
        ...                                 cells_per_rat=${cells_per_rat}
        ...                                 plan_to_copy_from=${plan_name}
        Check If Added Cells Are Present
        ...                                 base_cells_config=${cells_per_rat}
        ...                                 path_to_delta=${delta}
        Wait For Expected Fault 1868
        Delete Cells Via Delta
        ...                                 path_to_delta=${delta}
        ...                                 cells_per_rat=${cells_per_rat}
        Check If Deleted Cells Are No Longer Present
        ...                                 base_cells_config=${cells_per_rat}
        
        ${config_index}=                    Evaluate  ${config_index}+1
    END

